# <app> - build-time environment.
#
# Copy to .env.local and uncomment what you need. Only VITE_-prefixed names
# reach the bundle; everything else stays in the build process.
#
# Never put a secret here: the bundle ships to every user's browser and the
# SPA is a public client. The access token is supplied at runtime by the
# TokenStore port (src/core/ports.ts), never baked into the build.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
